WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.400
- But Blake and John are,

00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:03.270
they are terrified of you. Look at this.

00:00:03.270 --> 00:00:04.103
- Oh.

00:00:04.103 --> 00:00:05.080
- Yes.

00:00:05.080 --> 00:00:09.795
- Ariana has a huge fan
base and they are fervent.

00:00:09.795 --> 00:00:13.908
And if they show up to
vote, we're all in trouble.

00:00:13.908 --> 00:00:17.054
- 100%. Are you scared at all?

00:00:17.054 --> 00:00:20.110
- Now what? I'm not
afraid of her fan base.

00:00:20.110 --> 00:00:22.190
Where are they at? Look
at me. Where's the camera?

00:00:22.190 --> 00:00:24.363
Ariana fans, bring it on.
I'm not afraid of Ariana.

00:00:27.470 --> 00:00:30.840
- He is so afraid of Ariana's fan base.

00:00:30.840 --> 00:00:32.880
(audience laughs)

00:00:32.880 --> 00:00:34.760
Thoughts? We said this when you came in.

00:00:34.760 --> 00:00:35.593
I mean, it was apparent.

00:00:35.593 --> 00:00:36.960
Literally the entire
audience was screaming.

00:00:36.960 --> 00:00:40.380
We were like, "We have no
chance". Like it was amazing.

00:00:40.380 --> 00:00:41.600
- I don't know that that's true.

00:00:41.600 --> 00:00:43.192
- Well, I'm just saying, you have--

00:00:43.192 --> 00:00:44.670
- I really do not think
that's true. I mean--

00:00:44.670 --> 00:00:46.800
- But you're like, you're a huge star.

00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:48.371
I don't know, newsflash.

00:00:48.371 --> 00:00:50.561
- What are you talking
about, Kelly Clarkson?

00:00:50.561 --> 00:00:52.080
- What? No, I'm just staying!

00:00:52.080 --> 00:00:54.823
Like, it's one of those
things that you watch out.

00:00:54.823 --> 00:00:56.452
(audience applauds)

